  { title: 'Stay nearby, not at the gate', text: 'Accommodation directly at the attraction charges a premium. Staying 10-20 minutes away can save 30-50% on nightly rates. Use public transport or a rental car to bridge the gap.' },
  { title: 'Pack your own lunch', text: 'Tourist-area restaurants charge inflated prices. Pack sandwiches, snacks, and a refillable water bottle to save $15-30 per day on food. Buy supplies at local supermarkets or markets.' },
  { title: 'Free walking tours & guides', text: 'Many areas offer free or tip-based guided walks that are better than paid tours. Local guides provide insider knowledge and support the community. Check online for options.' },
  { title: 'Use local transport', text: 'Taxis and private transfers are the most expensive option. Local buses, shared minivans, or ride-sharing are 50-80% cheaper and give you a more authentic experience.' },
];

